  m_Name: Week3_Mission4_Dialogue_1 V2
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: 
  speakerName: Tandang
  speechLines:
  - First, remember the combination given to you presented in a sequence.
  - Each color and symbol is assigned to a button.
  - It can either be the Y button, the B button, the A button, or the X button.
  - After the combination is presented, press the buttons accordingly.
  - The buttons pressed must be the same, or else you will restart.
  - Good luck, kid.
